{
    "title": "Live Earth Map- Satellite View",
    "description": "Explore the world without limits with GPS navigation route planner app. Experience the world like never before with our comprehensive navigation features to enhance your every journey.\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features of GPS Navigation Satellite Map:</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Route Finder</b> \r\n\r\nPlan your trips seamlessly with our intelligent route planner, which optimizes your journey based on real-time traffic conditions, road closures, and your preferred travel mode, whether you're driving, cycling, or walking.\r\n\r\n<b>Location Tracking</b>\r\n\r\nNever lose your way with our precise location tracking feature. Driving directions pinpoint your current location and easily share it with friends and family.\r\n\r\n<b>Street View</b> \r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in your destination before you arrive with our immersive Street View feature. Explore streets, landmarks, and neighborhoods virtually to plan your itinerary effectively.\r\n\r\n<b>Parking Reminder</b>\r\n\r\nSay goodbye to parking woes with our convenient parking reminder feature. Set a timer for your parked car and receive timely alerts before your parking expires.\r\n\r\n<b>Nearby Places</b>\r\n\r\nDiscover hidden gems and popular attractions around you with our comprehensive nearby places feature. Explore restaurants, cafes, shops, and more, all conveniently categorized for easy browsing.\r\n\r\n<b>Area Calculator</b>\r\n\r\nCalculate distances and areas with ease using our handy area calculator feature. Perfect for measuring land parcels, planning landscaping projects, or simply satisfying your curiosity.\r\n\r\n<b>Traffic Locator</b>\r\n\r\nStay ahead of the traffic congestion with our real-time traffic locator feature. Visualize traffic conditions on your route and make informed decisions to avoid delays.\r\n\r\n<b>Compass</b>\r\n\r\nNever lose your bearings with our integrated compass feature. Always know which direction you're facing, whether you're hiking in the wilderness or exploring an unfamiliar city.\r\n\r\n<b>Live Weather</b>\r\n\r\nStay informed about the weather conditions at your destination with our live weather feature. Access real-time weather updates and forecasts to plan your activities accordingly.\r\n\r\nGPS Navigation Street View help you to elevate your travel experience, whether you're driving, walking, or exploring new destinations. \r\n\r\nWe really value your feedback as it helps us improve our app. If you have any problem or suggestion, please write to us at musghu445566@gmail.com",
